{"text":"But that is not what this conversation is about. Gender and class are different forms of oppression. I actually learned quite a bit about systems of oppression and how they can be blind to one another by talking to black men. I was once talking to a black man about gender and he said to me, why do you have to say my experience as a woman? Why can't it be your experience as a human being? Now, this was the same man who would often talk about his experience as a black man. Gender matters, men and women experience the world differently. Gender colors the way we experience the world, but we can change that. Some people will say, oh, but women have the real power, bottom power. And for non Nigerians, bottom power is an expression which I suppose means something like a woman who uses her sexuality to get favors from men. But bottom power is not power at all.","words":[{"text":"But","start":0.0,"end":0.66},{"text":"that","start":0.66,"end":0.8},{"text":"is","start":0.8,"end":0.92},{"text":"not","start":0.92,"end":1.1},{"text":"what","start":1.1,"end":1.28},{"text":"this","start":1.28,"end":1.42},{"text":"conversation","start":1.42,"end":3.46},{"text":"is","start":3.46,"end":4.82},{"text":"about","start":4.82,"end":5.2,"punct":"."},{"text":"Gender","start":7.3,"end":7.38},{"text":"and","start":7.38,"end":7.9},{"text":"class","start":7.9,"end":8.36},{"text":"are","start":8.36,"end":9.34},{"text":"different","start":9.34,"end":9.64},{"text":"forms","start":9.64,"end":9.94},{"text":"of","start":9.94,"end":10.12},{"text":"oppression","start":10.12,"end":10.5,"punct":"."},{"text":"I","start":11.02,"end":11.16},{"text":"actually","start":11.16,"end":11.52},{"text":"learned","start":11.52,"end":11.98},{"text":"quite","start":11.98,"end":12.36},{"text":"a","start":12.36,"end":12.54},{"text":"bit","start":12.54,"end":12.7},{"text":"about","start":12.7,"end":12.98},{"text":"systems","start":12.98,"end":13.46},{"text":"of","start":13.46,"end":13.68},{"text":"oppression","star